      ],
      "wordingIds": [
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::PlayDialoguePlayerQuestion(System.String)/IL_0022"
      ],
      "preserveIds": [
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::PlayDialoguePlayerQuestion(System.String)/IL_0092"
      ],
      "contract": "Empty arcListCache returns after the separate prior diagnostic at IL000d (role retained). Missing GetDialogueByDbName(arg1) logs prefix+arg1 at IL002d and returns. Success resolves initialActor.dbName, updates CurrentDialogue/DbName/PluginDbName, clears CurrentArc/Name, sets Primary/Initial/CurrentActor and player-question flag, writes trigger conversation at IL0097, Fire(null), then BuildDynamicConversation(cache.Keys,true,PrimaryActor.dbName,false) and LogPlayedDialogue(CurrentDialogueDbName). Original Fire-before-build order is preserved. Error prefix is not sent to any lookup."
    },
    {
      "method": "System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::PlayDynamicFastTravelDialogue(System.Collections.Generic.List`1<System.String>,System.String)",
      "key": "PlayDynamicFastTravelDialogue",
      "bodyEvidence": "../phase136/dynamic-consumers.il",
      "producerBodySha256": "a995e7edfcaf7ed6f1528f7febd1ccc85a419daaa69bd4316beec56cf474ce08",
      "ids": [
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::PlayDynamicFastTravelDialogue(System.Collections.Generic.List`1<System.String>,System.String)/IL_005a"
      ],
      "wordingIds": [],
      "preserveIds": [
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::PlayDynamicFastTravelDialogue(System.Collections.Generic.List`1<System.String>,System.String)/IL_005a"
      ],
      "contract": "Prior Penny and System_DynamicFastTravel identities remain exact. Returned dialogue updates CurrentDialogue and original plugin/db names; arcs are cleared, primary/initial/current actor set. Write system/fastTravel to trigger conversation IL005f, Fire(null), then BuildFastTravelConversation(destinationNames,customGreeting) and LogPlayedDialogue(CurrentDialogueDbName). Retain original call order and previously verified greeting overwrite/seven frozen dependencies; no runtime activation is asserted."
    },
    {
      "method": "System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::Handler_OnLinkedConversationStart(UnityEngine.Transform)",
      "key": "Handler_OnLinkedConversationStart",
      "bodyEvidence": "service.il",
      "producerBodySha256": "b6ae020e97cda59cfcd2c662b989ccce1d93e29d26d9f01eda4d8a2aae9ef17c",
      "ids": [
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::Handler_OnLinkedConversationStart(UnityEngine.Transform)/IL_0133"
      ],
      "wordingIds": [
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::Handler_OnLinkedConversationStart(UnityEngine.Transform)/IL_0133"
      ],
      "preserveIds": [],
      "contract": "Only while IsPlayerQuestionDialoguePlaying. Reads active conversation0 and current-state conversation ID, gets original Title. For dialogueType700 returns if current plugin conversation ID equals selected ID OR Title equals system/dynamicConversation (prior protected comparison). Otherwise clears player-question flag, matches selected ID against arcListCache.Values plugin conversation IDs; on match updates current dialogue, first primary arc/customName and actor state then invokes onLinkedDialogueStart. No match logs selected prefix+CurrentDialogue.dbName at IL0147 and returns. That diagnostic carries the previous current dbName, not the selected Title. Error wording never participates in matching."
    },
    {
      "method": "System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::HandleDialogueLineActor(PixelCrushers.DialogueSystem.Subtitle)",
      "key": "HandleDialogueLineActor",
      "bodyEvidence": "service.il",
      "producerBodySha256": "fc7e1ca3bfc97a1da25c14890228becd701dcb348159613567746ccd0258dbe5",
      "ids": [
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::HandleDialogueLineActor(PixelCrushers.DialogueSystem.Subtitle)/IL_0078"
      ],
      "wordingIds": [
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::HandleDialogueLineActor(PixelCrushers.DialogueSystem.Subtitle)/IL_0078"
      ],
      "preserveIds": [],
      "contract": "Lowercase sequence containing prior none/delay/continue tokens returns. Otherwise speakerInfo.id from current conversation subtitle is used; nonpositive ID falls back to GetActorPluginIdTheSlowWay, then returns if still nonpositive. GetActorByPluginDbId is stored as CurrentActor. Null result formats selected template with CurrentDialogueDbName in slot0 and numeric plugin actor ID in slot1, then Debug.LogError IL008d. Execution continues: detailed and generic onDialogueLineBegin receive resolved actor (possibly null) and subtitle/formatted text, OnConversationLine_Handler runs, and narrator/player/NPC events branch separately. Diagnostic wording is distinct from emitted formatted dialogue text."
    },
