        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::BuildDynamicConversation(System.Collections.Generic.IEnumerable`1<TheForestOfLove.Narrative.Arc>,System.Boolean,System.String,System.Boolean)/IL_008f"
      ],
      "contract": "Requires active conversation; resolves system/dynamicConversation plus PASSTHROUGH, DYNAMICROOT, DYNAMICQUESTIONS, GENERICFAREWELL. Clears outgoingLinks on questions and root. includeQuestions=true resolves actor by dbName, formats system/dynamicQuestions/{0} with actor.pluginDbName, links root to that conversation first entry, questions to every supplied Arc.pluginDbFirstDialogueEntry, then generic farewell. Otherwise root links to each arc. skipPlayerQuestion can select pluginDbFirstPlayerQuestionDialogueEntry, invoke Handler_OnConversationLineEnd for the omitted original first subtitle and, on prior player actor-name equality, select its first outgoing destination. Final ForceNextStateToLinkToEntry uses PASSTHROUGH. These keys select/control graph topology, not captions; caller flags/arc IDs/plugin actor names remain exact."
    },
