      "contract": "Resolves the same conversation and four node-title keys as the builder. PASSTHROUGH and GENERICFAREWELL lookup results are popped. Only DYNAMICQUESTIONS and DYNAMICROOT outgoingLinks are cleared. It does not restore the full original graph or change node Dialogue Text. Keep all five lookup operands even when results are discarded."
    },
