      "preserveIds": [
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::BuildFastTravelConversation(System.Collections.Generic.List`1<System.String>,System.String)/IL_0027",
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::BuildFastTravelConversation(System.Collections.Generic.List`1<System.String>,System.String)/IL_003a",
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::BuildFastTravelConversation(System.Collections.Generic.List`1<System.String>,System.String)/IL_0047",
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::BuildFastTravelConversation(System.Collections.Generic.List`1<System.String>,System.String)/IL_0068"
      ],
      "contract": "Requires active conversation, selects system/fastTravel, first entry, FASTTRAVELCANCEL and FT_DYNAMIC_ROOT; clears root links. Nonblank greeting selects FT_CUSTOM_GREETING, follows its first outgoing destination if present, and writes custom greeting to that node DialogueText only if found. Each supplied destination key matches every node Title by equality; matching nodes are linked from root, then cancellation is always appended. ForceNextStateToLinkToEntry uses first entry. Reuse prior exact ds:58:719 overwrite, destination gates/order, DeepWoods retention and seven frozen text dependencies; this packet adds the four compiled selector roles without new extraction."
    },
    {
      "method": "System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::LogPlayedDialogue(System.String)",
      "key": "LogPlayedDialogue",
      "bodyEvidence": "service.il",
      "producerBodySha256": "c85a2ad1f0e862628422b0dcab33d5b801686c971156f5f4af095f18c1e3ee70",
      "ids": [
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::LogPlayedDialogue(System.String)/IL_0000"
      ],
      "wordingIds": [],
      "preserveIds": [
        "il:Assembly-CSharp.dll/System.Void TheForestOfLove.Narrative.DialogueService::LogPlayedDialogue(System.String)/IL_0000"
      ],
      "contract": "prefix+arg1 dbName -> AddEventLog -> optional ServiceLocator GameplayLogManager -> LogMessage -> AddLogHistory(message,StoryClock) -> pooled/allocated GameplayLogHistory.message/timeUnlocked -> queue/CleanupLogHistory. Awake restores prior persisted messages, GetLogHistory yields queue (or empty list without manager). Existing GenerateRecentStoryEvents enumerates message with LF, falls back to persistent history only if combined text is empty; existing report submits it as Recent Events section. Scanned message-field uses also include save/restore/DeepCopy. No game, save write, report submission or external service operation occurred; no global absence inference from a bounded scan."
    }
